OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds set to pull Boeing 737
OL,4,Afor charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 30 teams are set to compete
OL,7,Fto pull a Boeing 737 aircraft in the
OL,8,Ffastest time to raise money for
OL,9,Fcharity.
OL,11,FThe Dorset Plane Pull at Bournemouth
OL,12,FAirport will see 35 teams, each made up
OL,13,Fof about 20 members, pull the 35-tonne
OL,14,Faircraft over a distance of 50m
OL,15,F(164ft).
OL,17,FThe event, which started in 2009, has
OL,18,Fraised #400,000 for charity and is now
OL,19,Fin its 17th year.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
