OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds set to pull Boeing 737
OL,4,Afor charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganiser Richard Griffin said: "We're
OL,7,Fabsolutely delighted to be returning
OL,8,Ffor the Dorset Plane Pull in 2026. We
OL,9,Fhave 20 amazing beneficiary charities
OL,10,Finvolved this year and have more than
OL,11,F30 eager teams ready to take on the
OL,12,Fchallenge."
